  Slug: champion-s-aura
  DisplayName: Champion's Aura
  IconPath: icons/magic/control/buff-flight-wings-runes-blue-white.webp
  Description: You're surrounded by an aura in a 15-foot emanation. It has the aura
    and divine traits. Any follower of your deity within the aura immediately knows
    you're a champion of your deity. This aura is used as the range for your champion's
    reaction and for various other effects. You can suppress or resume the aura as
    a single action, which has the concentrate trait, and it ends if you fall @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Unconscious].
